    <briefdescription>
<para>Configuration for a single topic handler. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Each handler entry in the YAML config maps to this struct. The handler_type determines which handler factory is used.</para>
<para>Note: For simple forwarding with downsampling, use the gateway&apos;s explicit_topics instead of creating a handler. Handlers are only needed for custom processing (e.g., image compression). </para>
    </detaileddescription>
